          "groundingSupports": [
            {
              "segment": {
                "endIndex": 215,
                "text": "Brisbane’s prestige apartment and off-the-plan penthouse sector has evolved dramatically, with inner-city and riverfront residences regularly commanding Sydney-style rates per square metre ($30,000–$45,000+/sqm)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 217,
                "endIndex": 445,
                "text": "A distinct group of boutique project marketing specialists and global agencies dominates the architectural project marketing space across Brisbane’s blue-chip enclaves (such as New Farm, Teneriffe, Kangaroo Point, and Toowong)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                2,
                3,
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 624,
                "endIndex": 715,
                "text": "**Profile:** Place is one of South East Queensland’s most entrenched real estate networks"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                5
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 717,
                "endIndex": 847,
                "text": "Its dedicated project arm, **Place Projects**, works hand-in-hand with Place Advisory to consult on project design, mix, and sales"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                6,
                5
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 849,
                "endIndex": 1000,
                "text": "For ultra-luxury and bespoke developments, Place’s prestige agents (most notably Simon Caulfield) often front the penthouse and whole-floor campaigns"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1034,
                "endIndex": 1215,
                "text": "Appointed on landmark riverfront developments including Spyre Group’s ultra-luxury **Moray House** in New Farm (achieving a $15.75M penthouse sale and full-floor riverfront sales)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                7,
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1221,
                "endIndex": 1310,
                "text": "Marketed prestigious architectural projects across New Farm, Kangaroo Point, and St Lucia"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1427,
                "endIndex": 1636,
                "text": "**Profile:** Headquartered in Newstead/Teneriffe, YPM Group is widely regarded as Brisbane’s pre-eminent independent project marketing specialist for architecturally significant, boutique luxury developments"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                10
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1638,
                "endIndex": 1801,
                "text": "They are known for consulting closely with elite developers and top architects (e.g., bureau^proberts, Rothelowman) to position high-value sky-homes and penthouses"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1835,
                "endIndex": 1941,
                "text": "**Arc Residences (Toowong):** Secured a record-breaking ~$13.6M off-the-plan penthouse sale by Spyre Group"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1947,
                "endIndex": 2066,
                "text": "**Sorano House (Kangaroo Point):** Facilitated the $14M off-the-plan penthouse sale at an internal rate of ~$45,000/sqm"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2072,
                "endIndex": 2204,
                "text": "Led residential marketing for the multi-billion-dollar **Queen’s Wharf Residences** and the record **Emporium Penthouse** campaign"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2292,
                "endIndex": 2549,
                "text": "**Profile:** TOTAL Property Group has spent over two decades specialising exclusively in off-the-plan residential project marketing, prestige development launches, and off-market penthouse transactions across Brisbane, the Gold Coast, and the Sunshine Coast"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12,
                13
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2551,
                "endIndex": 2630,
                "text": "They excel at marketing down-sizer, whole-floor, and trophy penthouse offerings"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12,
                14
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2664,
                "endIndex": 2801,
                "text": "Partnered with high-end Brisbane builders and developers including Tom Dooley Developments (TDD) on luxury riverfront Newstead residences"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2807,
                "endIndex": 2978,
                "text": "Extensive prestige portfolio across SEQ, including high-end projects like *Burly Residences*, *Royale Gold Coast* ($19M+ penthouses to Brisbane buyers), and the *Mondrian*"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                13,
                15,
                16
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3080,
                "endIndex": 3212,
                "text": "**Profile:** Combining global distribution (especially into Asia-Pacific HNW networks) with deep institutional development expertise"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                17
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3357,
                "endIndex": 3565,
                "text": "**443 Queen Street (Brisbane CBD):** Marketed Cbus Property’s award-winning, sub-tropical \"breathable\" tower designed by WOHA and Architectus, encompassing multi-million-dollar sub-penthouses and penthouses"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                18,
                19
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3571,
                "endIndex": 3687,
                "text": "Represented multiple high-profile architectural sky-homes, coastal towers, and urban renewal projects throughout SEQ"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                20,
                19
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3802,
                "endIndex": 4141,
                "text": "**Profile:** While known primarily for dominating Brisbane's established ultra-prestige housing market (New Farm, Ascot, Hamilton), the **Ray White Collective** frequently leverages its database of local and interstate high-net-worth buyers for boutique architectural developments, riverfront off-the-plan sky-homes, and prestige townhomes"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                21
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4175,
                "endIndex": 4390,
                "text": "Regularly acts as exclusive marketing partners for boutique prestige developers (e.g., Capital Luxury Residences) targeting owner-occupiers looking to trade high-maintenance estates for turnkey riverfront penthouses"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                21
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4484,
                "endIndex": 4672,
                "text": "**Profile:** Colliers acts across the entire project lifecycle—from brokering prime waterfront and inner-city development site acquisitions to executing full off-the-plan sales campaigns"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                22
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4674,
                "endIndex": 4851,
                "text": "Their residential project team typically handles larger medium-to-high density prestige developments for major corporate developers like Consolidated Properties Group and Mirvac"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                23,
                22
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4938,
                "endIndex": 5058,
                "text": "**Profile:** Operating for over 25 years, Position Property is Brisbane’s largest independent project marketing agency"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                24,
                25
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 5060,
                "endIndex": 5226,
                "text": "While they market across a broader price spectrum than boutique luxury specialists, they have a strong presence in the architectural and boutique owner-occupier space"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                24
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 5260,
                "endIndex": 5471,
                "text": "Known for long-term project marketing partnerships, including Pradella's multi-stage West End precinct (*The Lanes*, *Montague Markets*) and boutique penthouse enclaves in Taringa (*The Addison*) and Bowen Hills"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                26,
                27,
                28
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 5509,
                "endIndex": 5712,
                "text": "**For bespoke, ultra-luxury riverfront residences & trophy penthouses ($10M+):** **YPM Group** or **Place (via Simon Caulfield)** have the strongest track record in setting per-square-metre price records"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0,
                7,
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 5716,
                "endIndex": 5828,
                "text": "**For regional/SEQ-wide prestige reach and dedicated off-the-plan campaign expertise:** **TOTAL Property Group**"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12,
                13
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 5832,
                "endIndex": 5961,
                "text": "**For landmark institutional high-rise towers requiring global reach:** **CBRE Residential Projects** or **Colliers Residential**"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                17,
                23
              ]
            }
